OpenPlane CLI

Usage:
  openplane [command]

Core Commands
  analytics         Analytics APIs
  auth              Authentication commands
  completion        Generate shell completion script
  config            Profile configuration
  connectors        Connector operations
  integrations      Integration authentication flows
  search            Search indexed content
  teams             Team management
  version           Print version

Agent and Platform Commands
  agent             Agent execution APIs
  background-agents Background agent orchestration
  canvas            Agent canvas orchestration
  knowledge         Knowledge graph operations
  mcp               MCP APIs
  media             Media deep operations
  mission           Mission orchestration
  permissions       Permission and access controls
  rag               RAG workflows
  research          Research workflow orchestration

Extensions
  plugin            Manage CLI plugins

Additional Commands:
  help              Help about any command

Flags:
      --color string      Color mode: auto|always|never
      --debug             Enable debug behavior
  -h, --help              help for openplane
      --host string       API base URL
      --jq string         Filter JSON output with jq expression
      --no-color          Disable color output
      --non-interactive   Disable interactive prompts
      --output string     Output format: table|json|yaml|ndjson
      --profile string    Profile name
      --raw               Emit raw response body
      --team string       Team identifier
      --template string   Format output with Go template
      --timeout string    Request timeout (for example: 30s, 2m)
      --trace             Trace HTTP requests
  -y, --yes               Assume yes for confirmations

Use "openplane [command] --help" for more information about a command.
